            (because on these the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Poisson-Peierls+bracket"} Poisson-Peierls bracket
            of the theory is defined, theorem
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PPeierlsBracket"}
            below):
          #RegularLinearFieldObservables.num_defn
